; ---------- TPS_SWCT_02002 - DiagnosticValueNeeds / DataServices role ----------
; AtomicSwComponentType offers a PPortPrototype typed by ClientServerInterface to read/write current value via diagnostic services.
; Text gives: ServiceNeeds kind DiagnosticValueNeeds, RoleBasedPortAssignment valid roles: DataServices [1].

; Predicates to connect AtomicSwComponentType with its service dependencies and role-based port assignments.
(declare-fun has_serviceDependency (ATOMIC-SW-COMPONENT-TYPE SWC-SERVICE-DEPENDENCY) Bool)
