; =========================
; constr_1209 - Mapping of ModeDeclarations of mode user to ModeDeclaration of mode manager
; Expression:
;   "A configuration that maps several ModeDeclarations representing modes of a
;    mode user to one ModeDeclaration representing a mode of a mode manager
;    shall be rejected."
; =========================

; 逻辑：对于任意 mode manager 模式 m_mgr 和 mode user u：
; 不允许存在两个不同的 user 模式 u1, u2 被映射到同一个 m_mgr（在同一 manager/user 组合下）。
(assert
  (forall ((map1 MODE-DECLARATION-MAPPING)
           (map2 MODE-DECLARATION-MAPPING))
    (=> (and (is_ModeDeclarationMapping map1)
             (is_ModeDeclarationMapping map2)
             (not (= map1 map2))
             (= (mapping_managerMode map1) (mapping_managerMode map2))
             (= (mapping_manager map1) (mapping_manager map2))
             (= (mapping_user map1) (mapping_user map2)))
        (not (= (mapping_userMode map1) (mapping_userMode map2))))))

; 该公理禁止“同一 mode manager 模式 + 同一 mode user”被多个不同 user 模式映射到同一 manager 模式。

; =========================
; constr_1210 - Mapping of ModeDeclarations of mode user to all ModeDeclarations of mode manager
; Expression:
;   "If a ModeDeclarationMapping exists that references a ModeDeclaration
;    representing a mode of the mode manager then ModeDeclarationMappings shall
;    exist that map all modes of the mode manager to modes of the mode user."
; =========================

; 逻辑：
; 对任意 manager M、user U：
;   如果存在某个 mapping m0，将 manager 的某个模式 mm0 映射到 user 的某个模式 um0，
;   则对于 manager 的每个模式 mm，都必须存在一个 mapping m，将 mm 映射到某个 user 模式 um。
(assert
  (forall ((M MODE-MANAGER)
           (U MODE-USER))
    (=> (and (is_ModeManager M)
             (is_ModeUser U)
             (exists ((m0 MODE-DECLARATION-MAPPING))
               (and (is_ModeDeclarationMapping m0)
                    (= (mapping_manager m0) M)
                    (= (mapping_user m0) U))))
        (forall ((mm MODE-DECLARATION))
          (=> (and (is_ModeDeclaration mm)
                   (modeOfManager mm M))
              (exists ((m MODE-DECLARATION-MAPPING)
                       (um MODE-DECLARATION))
                (and (is_ModeDeclarationMapping m)
                     (= (mapping_manager m) M)
                     (= (mapping_user m) U)
                     (= (mapping_managerMode m) mm)
                     (is_ModeDeclaration um)
                     (= (mapping_userMode m) um)))))))

