; Chain semantics for VSA_RECTANGULAR:
; - Last ApplicationArrayDataType in chain: element with variableSize,
;   maxNumberOfElements defined, arraySizeHandling = allIndicesSameArraySize.
; - All previous ApplicationArrayDataTypes: element with variableSize,
;   maxNumberOfElements defined, arraySizeHandling = allIndicesSameArraySize,
