        (or (= (category x) "EXPLICIT_ORDER")
            (= (category x) "ALPHABETIC_ORDER")))))

; ===== constr_1400: Reference to a specific DataTransformation =====
; A specific DataTransformation shall only be referenced by either
; - a DataPrototypeMapping in role firstToSecondDataTransformation, or
